<!-- ════════════════ 12 · CLEAN WORK AREA ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Work area" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #0ea5e9;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="22 3 2 3 10 12.46 10 19 14 21 14 12.46 22 3"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">12</span>Coding agents</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Keep your agent's work area <span class="accent">clean</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="checklist">
        <div class="check-item">
          <span class="ck">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h4>Scope what the agent sees</h4>
            <p>Point it to the right files yourself, or give it a focused starting point and let it find the rest. Exclude noise with an ignore file. Every tool does this a little differently.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="check-item">
          <span class="ck">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <h4>Turn off unused tools</h4>
            <p>Every connected MCP server loads its tool definitions into the context, even unused ones. Review your active servers (Claude Code: <code>/mcp</code>, Cursor: Settings &rarr; MCP) and turn off what this task doesn't need. Cursor historically capped the tools sent to the model (around 40); treat any fixed number as out of date and check your client.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        A focused context is faster, cheaper and more accurate than a full one. So paste <strong>only the relevant error line, not entire logs</strong>.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "12" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "57" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
